  <h2>How the 4% works</h2>
  <p>You list a hoodie at $74.99 and your shipping cost is $7.99. The buyer sees <strong>$82.98 with FREE shipping</strong>. When it sells, the 4% marketplace fee ($3.32) comes out of your proceeds — the buyer never pays a cent more.</p>

  <h2>How free shipping works</h2>
  <p>Enter two numbers when you list a product: your item price and what shipping costs you. We combine them into a single buyer-facing price badged <span class="free-ship">FREE shipping</span>. Buyers love it, and you stay in control of your margins.</p>
